  unitName: Phoenix
  unitId: 10112
  unitNumber: 135
  description: A holy bird born from a volcano once every few millennia.Usually half-human,
    half-bird in appearance, in battle it turns into a fireball to attack. In Grand
    Gaia this species has a rare fondness for humans, who otherwise have many enemies.
    They like human passion and self-confidence. Their tails can heal and it's said
    they appear near brave, injured soldiers.
  summonDesc: A stout heart beats fire.<br>This is why I entrust my <br>fire to you.
  fusionDesc: More.<br>My fire needs to be fed.
